{"version":1,"content":"<p>以下是外媒 Wccftech 針對任天堂 Switch 2 版《塞爾達傳説：時之笛》（The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time）重製版發佈的評測。作者 Nathan Birch 給出了 9.5 / 10 的超高分，評價它為「經典重製的全新標杆」，不僅完全值得玩，甚至被譽為系列不可動搖的巔峯。 </p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1585002.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:25:38.802095+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T11:12:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:26.139257+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:26.139257+00:00","content_hash":"f2712b0b16f6b3be6d3dca4197a311d5eb03389cc3bf97cd983adeff218d7fb7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}